            <div class="who">Craig B. · Denver, CO · 13 Hcp</div>
          </div>
          <div class="testi">
            <span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
            <p>Finally understand what holding lag actually feels like. My pro’s been telling me for years — this showed me in one session.</p>
            <div class="who">Dan R. · Austin, TX · 14 Hcp</div>
          </div>
        </div>
